+  /* A completed context is held by the gNB for its own NGAP guard (3000 ms
+     measured), so while we are CONNECTED there is nothing to do: starting a new
+     RA here is the refuted churn path (Msg5 104 -> InitialUEMessage 7, hold
+     collapsed back to 1999 ms). Wait for the gNB to release us, then take a new
+     slot from IDLE on a later tick. */
