+     skip every attack knob (occupancy target, RA gate, ACK gate) - those exist
+     to shape the storm, not the thing being measured. Logs one probe_attempt
+     per try and one probe_connected with the try count and the elapsed time,
+     so the result is "how long did a normal UE need" instead of a coin flip. */
